description:
Few methods on AuthenticationManagementResource (both server-side and amin client) expects input parameter as "Map<String, String> data" and then data are manually parsed on server-side. For example like this:
{code}
 String alias = data.get("alias");
 String type = data.get("type");
 String provider = data.get("provider");
 String description = data.get("description");
{code}
Seems this is not very nice and type-safe. IMO there should be proper "representation" objects used on both server-side and admin-client, so it's more clear what are expected inputs.

